# The Docker build context is admin/ (server/Dockerfile, merge task M4). Only
# what the image needs goes in: the server's code and the admin's pages. Never
# data, .env, node_modules, the build archive or a local web/js/config.js.
*
!server/package.json
!server/package-lock.json
!server/src
!server/scripts
!web
web/js/config.js
web/README.md
**/.DS_Store
